## Checklist

Before completing a feature:
- [ ] Created proper directory structure
- [ ] `LoadingState.tsx` exists and is used
- [ ] `ErrorState.tsx` exists with retry button
- [ ] `EmptyState.tsx` exists for empty data
- [ ] Main component handles loading → error → content order
- [ ] Hook contains all data fetching and handlers
- [ ] Utilities imported from `@/lib/date` and `@/lib/string`
- [ ] All `index.ts` files have proper exports
